  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Interview with Jim James**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Interview with Jim James**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Interview with Jim James**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Rocket Man (Jim James solo acoustic)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Interview with Jim James**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Interview with Jim James**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: At Dawn (Jim James solo acoustic), Evelyn Is Not Real, I Think I'm Going To Hell, Xmas Curtain, Picture Of You, War Begun [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2000-01-26.avonden** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 64 min [1]\n- **mmj2000-01-26.clublek**: FM broadcast; 8 songs; 36 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: DJ [1]\n- The session was broadcast in three parts on April 13, July 13, and August 24, 2000 [1]\n- Four tracks aired live on air, while four additional played tracks were preserved via Real Audio [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2000-01-26.avonden**: taped by Magnix; transferred by Magnix; source: VPRO Radio 5 AM cable broadcast > Cassette [1]. Also: Audio captured from VPRO Radio 5 AM cable broadcast onto cassette, then digitized to FLAC; Total running time is 1 hour 03 minutes 33 seconds, with 44 minutes 11 seconds of music [1]\n- **mmj2000-01-26.clublek**: taped by Paul B. (FM) / Magnix (RA); transferred by Magnix; source: VPRO Radio 3FM broadcast (tracks 1-4) / Real Audio (tracks 5-8) > Cassette [2]. Also: Cassette recordings were converted to PC WAV, then CD-R, EAC, and FLAC level 8 [2]",
